UID:10001856-1791730800-1791730800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:The Statler Experience
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $24 $34 $44 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Statler Experience brings the timeless harmonies of The Statler Brothers back to the stage in a heartfelt celebration featuring the next generation of Statler family talent: Wilson Fairchild (Wil & Langdon Reid) and Jack and Davis Reid. \nAs sons and grandsons of original Statler Brothers members\, these artists carry not only the sound — but the spirit — of one of country music’s most beloved vocal groups. Audiences will hear classic hits like “Flowers on the Wall\,” “Bed of Rose’s\,” “Do You Remember These\,” and “Elizabeth\,” delivered with the rich harmonies\, warmth\, and authenticity that defined the original quartet. \nBeyond the music\, The Statler Experience offers personal stories\, humor\, and behind-the-scenes memories that connect generations of fans to the heart of the Statler legacy. It’s more than a tribute — it’s a family tradition brought to life on stage. \nIf you cherish classic country\, tight harmonies\, and songs that stand the test of time\, this is an evening you won’t want to miss. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance. \n 
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-statler-experience/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/TSE_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
