SUMMARY:The 2026 Christmas Show: Winter Wonderland
DESCRIPTION:Step into the magic of the season with Winter Wonderland\, American Music Theatre’s 2026 Christmas show! From a charming Bavarian village to the festive North Pole\, this dazzling production features stunning sets\, gorgeous costumes\, and live performances of your favorite sacred and secular holiday songs. With our sensational cast\, live orchestra\, and even a visit from Santa\, it’s a joyful experience for the whole family—and a holiday tradition for all!
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-2026-christmas-show-winter-wonderland-46/
